  << /ActualText (Explanation\072\nOpening the file\072 We open the file test\056txt in read mode\056\nUsing fseek\050\051\072 The pointer is moved to the 10th byte from the beginning of the file \050SEEK\137SET\051\056\nReading from the file\072 The fgets\050\051 function reads 10 characters from the current position \050after seeking\051\056\nPrinting the content\072 The content read is printed to the console\056\nClosing the file\072 It\031s important to close the file after the operation\056)
